{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"variable-filterfn-innumberrange","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Variable: filterFn_inNumberRange"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const filterFn_inNumberRange: CreatedFilterFn<any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts#L285","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts:285"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keeps rows whose numeric value is inside an inclusive "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[min, max]"},{"type":"text","value":" range."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Filter values are normalized so blank endpoints become open-ended and\nreversed endpoints are swapped. Only real numbers can fall inside the\nrange: non-numeric row values ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":", strings, booleans)\nnever match."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"variable-filterfn-innumberrange","text":"Variable: filterFn_inNumberRange","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Variable: filterFn\\_inNumberRange\n\n```ts\nconst filterFn_inNumberRange: CreatedFilterFn<any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts:285](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts#L285)\n\nKeeps rows whose numeric value is inside an inclusive `[min, max]` range.\n\nFilter values are normalized so blank endpoints become open-ended and\nreversed endpoints are swapped. Only real numbers can fall inside the\nrange: non-numeric row values (`null`, `undefined`, strings, booleans)\nnever match.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: filterFn_inNumberRange\ntitle: filterFn_inNumberRange\n---\n\n# Variable: filterFn\\_inNumberRange\n\n```ts\nconst filterFn_inNumberRange: CreatedFilterFn<any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts:285](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts#L285)\n\nKeeps rows whose numeric value is inside an inclusive `[min, max]` range.\n\nFilter values are normalized so blank endpoints become open-ended and\nreversed endpoints are swapped. Only real numbers can fall inside the\nrange: non-numeric row values (`null`, `undefined`, strings, booleans)\nnever match.\n"}
